(* The package m5-speaker under the grades of timed operations: tones on the
   speaker of an M5Stack core, through M5Unified. Grades: the regex grades with
   banked delays, the timed regex grades and inter-arrival, over rational
   delays, in milliseconds; the operation is its own trace, within the bounds
   of its running time. Beep, its bounds and its default implementation are
   those of m5_speaker.tpe. *)

operation Beep : nat * nat ~> unit ! {Beep} within (0, 0.15]
default Beep _ = delay 3/20
